  "bodyHash": "202c37749948dd81",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<em>Identity</em>&nbsp;是一款受&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morph\" rel=\"nofollow\">Morph</a>&nbsp;启发的模组，最初基于 Fabric 模组加载器开发，现已通过 Architectury 适配至 Forge。如需了解 Identity 的配置方法及 API 交互信息，<a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">请访问维基页面</a>！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本项目在 Fabric 和 Forge 上均需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API </a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">借助&nbsp;<em>Identity</em>，你可以化身为任何你想要的模样：是友是敌，是冷是热，是蓬松还是粗糙。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ypdqdDU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B1iV81n.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f9eab3752713ce2496761d2ae215783aa19fe056d%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f7a4d68504666482e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9eab3752713ce2496761d2ae215783aa19fe056d/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f7a4d68504666482e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f5875dabf34c3506e13530cd73dfb67c6b85b0a67%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f30376b487646742e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/5875dabf34c3506e13530cd73dfb67c6b85b0a67/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f30376b487646742e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fabe860344f843b7303e03eec09086eef2c474345%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4837696239374e2e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/abe860344f843b7303e03eec09086eef2c474345/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4837696239374e2e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252f04ad10a80b914173ceca4aecd5ca0e1aa10891ae%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f544d41305051572e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/04ad10a80b914173ceca4aecd5ca0e1aa10891ae/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f544d41305051572e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcamo.githubusercontent.com%252fe969e8fa7f814624b80e88041756518882164fb2%252f68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f56797a614359332e706e67\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e969e8fa7f814624b80e88041756518882164fb2/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f56797a614359332e706e67\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity#getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>入门指南</h4>\n<p>击败附近的生物即可解锁一项&nbsp;<em>Identity</em>。你会在快捷栏上方看到解锁通知。随后可按 ` 键在不同身份之间切换。装备某项身份后，按下“R”键即可使用其能力。欲查看可用能力列表，请<a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity/wiki/Abilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>访问维基页面。</p>\n<h4><a href=\"https://github.com/Draylar/identity#license\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>许可证</h4>\n<p>Identity 采用 MIT 许可证授权。</p>",
